    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d261">

                <pb facs="0481" n="471" xml:id="pg471"/>

                <head>Mr. Leech to Mr. Jackson.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">St. John,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-12-10"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 10, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>I am informed by the Secretary of State that steamer Chesapeake, of Portland and
                    New York line, has been taken possession of by supposed insurgents on board, off
                    Cape Cod, the second engineer killed, and the captain landed at St. John, New
                    Brunswick. We are instructed to use our best efforts to cause the arrest of the
                    criminals, and the detention of the steamer. Am requested to inform you she has
                    not been seen here.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C. O. LEACH, <hi rendition="#italic">United States
                    Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
